# Pathway Church Solutions — UI Kit
A unified design system for building all UI components, pages, and modules in the Pathway Church Solutions application.

---

## 1. Color System

### Brand Colors
- **brand.navy** — #1E2A38  
- **brand.gold** — #D4A94A  
- **brand.slateBlue** — #4A5E7B  
- **brand.slateBlueDark** — #2F3E52  

### Neutrals
- **neutral.white** — #FFFFFF  
- **neutral.warmLight** — #F7F4EF  
- **neutral.warmMedium** — #E8EBF2  
- **neutral.gray** — #3C4A57  
- **neutral.grayLight** — #D9DCE2  

### Text Colors
- **text.primary** — brand.navy  
- **text.secondary** — neutral.gray  
- **text.inverse** — neutral.white  
- **text.accent** — brand.gold  

### Semantic Colors
- **success** — #4CAF50  
- **warning** — #FFC107  
- **error** — #C94A4A  

---

## 2. Typography

### Font Families
- **Primary:** Inter  
- **Secondary (optional):** Source Sans Pro  

### Display
- **Display XL** — 56px / bold / navy  
- **Display LG** — 48px / bold / navy  

### Headings
- **H1** — 48px / bold / navy  
- **H2** — 32px / bold / navy  
- **H3** — 22px / bold / navy  

### Body
- **Body Large** — 20px / regular / slate  
- **Body Medium** — 18px / regular / slate  
- **Body Small** — 16px / regular / slate  

### Supporting
- **Caption** — 14px / regular / gray  
- **Label** — 18px / medium / navy  

