## 6. Layout & Grid

### Desktop
- 12 columns  
- 24px gutters  
- 32px margins  
- Max width: 1200px  

### Tablet
- 8 columns  
- 20px gutters  
- Max width: 900px  

### Mobile
- 4 columns  
- 16px gutters  
- Max width: 600px  

### Section Padding
- Desktop: 100px  
- Tablet: 80px  
- Mobile: 60px  

---

## 7. Component Styles

### Buttons

#### Primary Button
- Height: 56px  
- Radius: 12px  
- Background: brand.gold  
- Text: brand.navy, 20px bold  
- Shadow: soft  

#### Secondary Button
- Border: 2px brand.navy  
- Background: transparent  
- Text: navy  
- Radius: 12px  

#### Text Button
- Text: navy  
- Underline on hover  

---

### Inputs

#### Text Input
- Height: 56px  
- Background: white  
- Border: 1px neutral.grayLight  
- Radius: 16px  
- Padding: 16px  
- Text: navy  

#### Textarea
- Min height: 120px  
- Same styling as input  

---

### Cards

#### Standard Card
- Background: white  
- Border: 1px neutral.grayLight  
- Radius: 16px  
- Shadow: medium  
- Padding: 24px  

#### Section Card
- Background: neutral.warmLight  
- Radius: 16px  
- Padding: 32px  

#### Interactive Card
- Background: white  
- Border: 2px transparent  
- Radius: 16px  
- Shadow: soft  
- Selected: border gold + shadow.deep  

---

### Headers

#### Page Header
- H1 + Body Large  
- Spacing: 24px  

#### Section Header
- H2  
- Gold underline (4px)  
- Spacing: 24px  

---

### Navigation

#### Top Nav
- Height: 80px  
- Background: white  
- Links: navy, 18px medium  

#### Footer
- Background: navy  
- Links: white  
- Tagline: 16px light white  

---

## 8. Iconography

### Style
- Stroke icons  
- 2px line weight  
- Colors: navy or gold  
- Sizes: 24px or 48px  

### Usage
- Navy = functional  
- Gold = accent  

---

## 9. Interaction States

### Hover
- Buttons: darken gold  
- Links: underline + gold tint  
- Cards: lift with medium shadow  

### Focus
- 2px gold outline  

### Active
- Compressed shadow  

### Disabled
- 40% opacity  

---

## 10. Motion

### Timing
- Fast: 120–180ms  
- Medium: 240–300ms  
- Large: 300–400ms  

### Easing
- Standard ease‑in‑out  

### Motion Rules
- Buttons: subtle press  
- Cards: gentle lift  
- Modals: fade + slide up  
- Dropdowns: fade + scale 98% → 100%  

---

## 11. Imagery

### Photography
- Warm, pastoral, natural lighting  
- Real churches, real people  
- Soft shadows  

### Illustration
- Minimal  
- Soft edges  
- Navy + gold accents  

### Screenshot Frames
- Background: white  
- Radius: 16px  
- Shadow: medium  

